pret the physical meaning of these values.", "choices": [{"id": "DA2D924984E745D8BE6305AA4E9FCEAA", "label": "A", "html": "M'(1) = -54, M'(6) = -8; The amount of medication in the bloodstream is decreasing at a rate of 54 mg/hr at t = 1 hour, and is decreasing at a rate of 8 mg/hr at t = 6 hours.", "text": "M'(1) = -54, M'(6) = -8; The amount of medication in the bloodstream is decreasing at a rate of 54 mg/hr at t = 1 hour, and is decreasing at a rate of 8 mg/hr at t = 6 hours."}, {"id": "89B3DEB3BAD64BCB988D79DEA37B4FD0", "label": "B", "html": "M'(1) = -28, M'(6) = -2; The amount of medication in the bloodstream is decreasing at a rate of 28 mg/hr at t = 1 hour, and is decreasing at a rate of 2 mg/hr at t = 6 hours.", "text": "M'(1) = -28, M'(6) = -2; The amount of medication in the bloodstream is decreasing at a rate of 28 mg/hr at t = 1 hour, and is decreasing at a rate of 2 mg/hr at t = 6 hours."}, {"id": "76D2D51AC5224B968636EA0D9B262BFB", "label": "C", "html": "M'(1) = -92, M'(6) = -6; The amount of medication in the bloodstream is decreasing at a rate of 92 mg/hr at t = 1 hour, and is decreasing at a rate of 6 mg/hr at t = 6 hours.", "text": "M'(1) = -92, M'(6) = -6; The amount of medication in the bloodstream is decreasing at a rate of 92 mg/hr at t = 1 hour, and is decreasing at a rate of 6 mg/hr at t = 6 hours."}, {"id": "EE70F385B972494187F74CC35818A3B6", "label": "D", "html": "M'(1) = -140, M'(6) = -3; The amount of medication in the bloodstream is decreasing at a rate of 140 mg/hr at t = 1 hour, and is decreasing at a rate of 3 mg/hr at t = 6 hours.", "text": "M'(1) = -140, M'(6) = -3; The amount of medication in the bloodstream is decreasing at a rate of 140 mg/hr at t = 1 hour, and is decreasing at a rate of 3 mg/hr at t = 6 hours."}], "correct_choice_ids": ["DA2D924984E745D8BE6305AA4E9FCEAA"], "correct_choice_indices": [0], "accepted_answers": [], "solution_html": "", "solution_text": "", "feedback_html": {}, "images": [{"src": "assets/calct3bc/ppg/